OL,4,CCrew unaware of risks before Mike      
OL,5,CLynch's yacht Bayesian sank, say       
OL,6,Cinvestigators                          
OL,7,GThe crew of the Bayesian superyacht    
OL,8,Gdid not know about critical safety     
OL,9,Grisks that left it vulnerable in       
OL,10,Gpowerful winds before it sank off the  
OL,11,Gcoast in northern Sicily, killing      
OL,12,Gseven people, British investigators    
OL,13,Gsay.                                   
OL,15,FBritish tech tycoon Mike Lynch, 59,    
OL,16,Fand his daughter Hannah, 18, were      
OL,17,Famong seven people who died when the   
OL,18,Fvessel sank on 19 August 2024.         
